## Symptoms of diabetes

- · thirst
- · frequent urination
- · blurring  of vision
- · fatigue

## Signs of diabetes

- · unintentional weight loss
- · signs of acute metabolic deterioration (signs of severe dehydration, Kussmaul's respiration, vomiting, altered level of consciousness)
- · clinical signs of chronic complications (acute coronary disease, stroke, kidney disease, vision loss, diabetic foot)

